  "data": {
    "parameterized": true,
    "summary": "Scouts X: during Resolve Pre-battle Abilities, a unit whose models all have this ability can do one of two things. A unit in Strategic Reserves may be placed anywhere wholly inside your deployment zone; a unit already wholly inside your deployment zone may instead make a Scout move. A DEDICATED TRANSPORT wholly inside your deployment zone whose embarked models all have this ability is also allowed a Scout move.",
